<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish June trade surplus 639.7 million punts-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish June trade surplus 639.7 million punts-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's seasonally-adjusted trade surplus widened to 639.7 million punts in June from 603.3 million in May, Central Statistics Office figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>			   Imports	Exports	     Gap</p>
<p> June 1996	     1,864.9	2,504.6	     639.7</p>
<p> May 1996		1,769.3	2,372.5	     603.3</p>
<p> June 1995	     1,627.1	2,203.7	     576.5</p>
<p>		   (Figures in millions of punts)</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
